      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MISS GOLDIE (2) turned spotting a big start finishing eighth (19.48) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Ready to return to form. BIG TOWN TILLY (1) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing sixth (30.71) in a Grade 4/5 at this track. Has a good record here including six wins. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings three times from six starts. Worth another chance. MOSES MAGIC (6) is progressing well with another good run last time, placing (23.37) last time out at Dubbo. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Hard to beat again. GRAVEL DUST (4) was a huge winner last start. Must be respected.",
